# Perception's own copy of the Nebius key, used by the teacher.
#
# Separate from the Worker's .dev.vars on purpose: the Worker runs the planner
# (text only) and perception runs the teacher (needs the frames), so the two
# processes hold their own credentials and neither reaches across.
#
# Without this, everything still runs. Escalation is skipped and mid-band
# cases go unresolved rather than failing.
NEBIUS_API_KEY=

# Optional. All of these have working defaults; see README.md.
# PACT_ROOM=gym
# PACT_HUB=http://localhost:8787
# PACT_SOURCE=folder
# PACT_EMBED=stub
# PACT_RESOLUTION=384
